Shahedeen Bayn Karte The Mere Beta Ali Akbar<br>
zaeefi Me Pidar Hai Thokre Khata Ali Akbar<br>
<br>
1.na Barchi Iske Seene Par Lagaao Aye Musalmano<br>
ke Hamshakle Payambar Hai,mera Beta Ali Akbar<br>
shahedeen Bayn Karte The Mere Beta Ali Akbar<br>
<br>
2. Kaha Laila Ne Akbar Ko Mila De Mujhse Aye Maalik<br>
na Jaane Kho Gaya Jaaker,kaha Mera Ali Akbar<br>
shahedeen Bayn Karte The Mere Beta Ali Akbar<br>
<br>
3. Jawaan Ki Laash Uthani Hai Madad Ko Aaiye Baba<br>
hussain Ibne Ali Padhte,the Ye Nauha Ali Akbar<br>
shahedeen Bayn Karte The Mere Beta Ali Akbar<br>
<br>
4.fughaan Karti Thi Har Bibi Ajab Manzar Tha Qaimo Me<br>
chala Tha Rukhsate Aaqir,ko Jab Mera Ali Akbar<br>
shahedeen Bayn Karte The Mere Beta Ali Akbar<br>
<br>
5. Ali Ro Ro Ke Deti Thi Sada Ye Zainab E Muztar<br>
haram Ko Yaad Aata Hai,tera Chehra Ali Akbar<br>
shahedeen Bayn Karte The Mere Beta Ali Akbar